  <name>The Forge IV</name>
  <description>1 effort block peaking at 82% in 75 minutes. Find a rhythm and commit to it — the clock is your only opponent. This trains your muscles to work efficiently at high glycolytic demand. The sensation is controlled burning — not agony, not comfort.</description>
